\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The fourteen-rung ladder at a matched budget, by tier. Conditioning helps six rungs (largest: Hotelling $T^2$, from $0.06$ to $1.00$), leaves the detection rate of six unchanged (four at ceiling, SPE at $0.75$, BOCPD at zero) and hurts two learned novelty models. BOCPD detects nothing on either arm (gradual ramps against an abrupt-change model); ADWIN's integer statistic leaves it only $d{+}1$ operating points.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ladder}{{2}{3}{The fourteen-rung ladder at a matched budget, by tier. Conditioning helps six rungs (largest: Hotelling $T^2$, from $0.06$ to $1.00$), leaves the detection rate of six unchanged (four at ceiling, SPE at $0.75$, BOCPD at zero) and hurts two learned novelty models. BOCPD detects nothing on either arm (gradual ramps against an abrupt-change model); ADWIN's integer statistic leaves it only $d{+}1$ operating points}{figure.2}{}}
